hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"217","\Allah’s Messenger said (Allah bless him and give him peace): Three things are not to be rejected: cushions"," oil and perfume"," and milk.’”"""
"218","\Allah’s Messenger said (Allah bless him and give him peace): 'Men's perfume is perfume whose scent is apparent and whose color is not"," and women's perfume is perfume\nwhose color is apparent and whose scent is not'.”"""
"219","\Allah’s Messenger said (Allah bless him and give him peace): 'Men's perfume is perfume whose scent is apparent and whose color is not"," and women's perfume is perfume\nwhose color is apparent and whose scent is not'.”"""
